And I will always be here by your side.

28
00:02:33,260 --> 00:02:35,937
To take care of you.

29
00:02:36,020 --> 00:02:40,097
Even in the darkest of times I'll try.

30
00:02:40,180 --> 00:02:42,557
Looking brave, it's alright.

31
00:02:42,640 --> 00:02:46,897
Cause we are the ones who
are meant to move them up.

32
00:02:46,980 --> 00:02:49,617
We will move to a rushing horizon.

33
00:02:49,700 --> 00:02:52,517
We will find insanity for sure.

34
00:02:52,600 --> 00:02:57,317
We will step ahead, we will win for sure.

35
00:02:57,400 --> 00:03:00,817
Dreaming on, we will
move towards the horizon.

36
00:03:00,900 --> 00:03:03,737
We will fight however we can.

37
00:03:03,820 --> 00:03:06,637
In order to be the best, we will run.

38
00:03:06,720 --> 00:03:09,357
To the top, to the end.

39
00:03:09,440 --> 00:03:15,260
