We beg of you.

75
00:06:02,520 --> 00:06:04,755
At least let us die a samurai's death.

76
00:06:05,080 --> 00:06:06,100
It's all we ask.

77
00:06:06,260 --> 00:06:08,142
To pass with the Cotton in hand.

78
00:06:08,400 --> 00:06:09,940
Don't stand in our way!

79
00:06:12,180 --> 00:06:15,000
