90
00:07:22,340 --> 00:07:25,460
Oh, oh, oh, oh.

91
00:07:36,820 --> 00:07:37,957
Shulaji!

92
00:07:38,040 --> 00:07:39,177
Shulaji!

93
00:07:39,260 --> 00:07:41,037
Shulaji! Shulaji!

94
00:07:41,120 --> 00:07:41,980
Shulaji!

95
00:07:43,460 --> 00:07:46,180
At least let us die a samurai death.

96
00:07:53,340 --> 00:07:54,740
Oh,

97
00:07:55,200 --> 00:08:00,860
my God.

98
00:08:23,460 --> 00:08:24,457
Tsunachi!

99
00:08:24,540 --> 00:08:25,620
Tsunachi!

100
00:08:49,340 --> 00:08:51,757
Why did we all have to
suffer this pain for

101
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:55,557
20 long years we'll know
once the job is done?

102
00:08:55,640 --> 00:09:02,357
Surely there is a deeper
meaning I have no reason

103
00:09:02,440 --> 00:09:08,100
to doubt Lord Odin listen
we've got a new goal

104
00:09:10,880 --> 00:09:16,377
Eight days from now is the
fire festival in the name of

105
00:09:16,460 --> 00:09:21,800
Kozuki Odin we'll raid Onigashima
Seek out the pirate invaders!

106
00:09:22,100 --> 00:09:25,540
Drag Orochi and Kaido out
of hiding and kill them!

107
00:09:27,960 --> 00:09:32,900
If you still have the metal to fight
back, then rise up and follow me!

108
00:09:43,500 --> 00:09:45,040
Count us in, Chief!

109
00:09:45,520 --> 00:09:47,800
It's about time we wreck those guys!

110
