But keep in mind, we're now 20
years stronger than you, young 'un.

114
00:10:07,060 --> 00:10:08,220
Tell him, doggy.

115
00:10:08,520 --> 00:10:10,226
You, Kara, make a good point.

116
00:10:13,400 --> 00:10:14,760
