I'm sorry.

156
00:12:03,400 --> 00:12:04,440
It's painful.

157
00:12:05,120 --> 00:12:07,200
Please help me. One sec.

158
00:12:08,000 --> 00:12:09,317
You don't need a pirate.

159
00:12:09,400 --> 00:12:10,230
Help me.

160
