173
00:12:57,080 --> 00:12:59,960
I possess every right to
be Shogun of this land!

174
00:13:00,320 --> 00:13:02,400
Do something about it, prove it!

175
00:13:05,060 --> 00:13:07,020
We don't want them here.

176
00:13:21,160 --> 00:13:22,840
Go on, Momo!

177
00:13:23,640 --> 00:13:26,280
Stop that! You're crazy! You'll kill me!

178
