Do I have to spill it out, dummy?

179
00:13:29,520 --> 00:13:31,300
They're waiting for you!

180
00:13:32,400 --> 00:13:33,230
Ahh!

181
00:13:36,060 --> 00:13:36,890
YES!

182
00:13:51,120 --> 00:13:51,950
Ahhh!

183
00:13:52,440 --> 00:13:53,760
Ahh!

184
00:13:54,520 --> 00:13:55,440
Ahh!

185
00:13:56,020 --> 00:13:56,850
Ahh!

186
00:13:57,180 --> 00:13:58,360
Aah! Ahh! Ahh!

187
00:14:05,400 --> 00:14:06,280
Impossible.

188
