190
00:14:34,020 --> 00:14:35,817
You're still alive!

191
00:14:35,900 --> 00:14:37,220
I can't believe it.

192
00:14:45,800 --> 00:14:47,660
I see now.

193
00:14:48,480 --> 00:14:50,997
It's not the promise That we were lacking.

194
00:14:51,080 --> 00:14:52,840
But a dream.

195
00:14:53,880 --> 00:14:57,140
A driving force that
lies Beyond the battle?

196
00:14:58,660 --> 00:15:00,300
I've accomplished nothing.

197
00:15:01,080 --> 00:15:04,840
What they see is not myself,
but the memory of my father.

198
00:15:05,460 --> 00:15:09,578
The great shadow cast by him that
protected the land of Wano long ago.

199
00:15:24,000 --> 00:15:24,830
I...

200
00:15:24,913 --> 00:15:25,920
I cannot do this.

201
00:15:27,140 --> 00:15:29,400
Look, it's too much.

202
00:15:44,140 --> 00:15:47,300
I want to vanquish Everikido!

203
00:15:59,500 --> 00:16:03,200
Momonosuke, you mustn't
be afraid. Breathe.

204
00:16:06,420 --> 00:16:08,020
You must be strong.

205
00:16:08,580 --> 00:16:10,080
You are a lord.

206
00:16:16,380 --> 00:16:17,210
Attention!

207
00:16:17,800 --> 00:16:19,420
Please hear me out!

208
00:16:21,420 --> 00:16:24,620
I shall speak to you of the
journey I have undertook.

209
00:16:25,180 --> 00:16:26,980
After arriving in the present,

210
00:16:27,140 --> 00:16:30,611
I sent out with Kin'emon and
the others in search of allies.

211
00:16:30,720 --> 00:16:33,720
However, we were struck
with tragedy and separated.

212
00:16:33,980 --> 00:16:37,451
I found myself in a dangerous
place with no hope of escape.

213
00:16:37,780 --> 00:16:41,898
I faced many trials, and if not for
the aid of Luffy and his comrades,

214
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:44,597
I surely would not be
standing here before you.

215
00:16:44,680 --> 00:16:48,120
I know I may be weak and lack experience,

216
00:16:48,520 --> 00:16:54,520
but I will avenge my family and the
land of Wano, no matter what it takes.

217
00:16:55,580 --> 00:16:59,577
even in my darkest hour i was
able to carry on because i held on

218
00:16:59,660 --> 00:17:06,257
to one dear thing a dream my goal
is clear i must find like-minded

219
00:17:06,340 --> 00:17:11,237
allies my countrymen you are the
people who support i need more than

220
00:17:11,320 --> 00:17:17,380
ever the people of this land every
one of us shares the same desire

221
00:17:19,220 --> 00:17:20,860
Take back our home!

222
00:17:21,080 --> 00:17:22,320
The land of Wano!

223
00:17:23,460 --> 00:17:27,180
I know you've suffered greatly,
waiting for all these years!

224
00:17:27,440 --> 00:17:30,460
So I thank you with all of
my heart for your faith!

225
00:17:38,060 --> 00:17:41,440
I am heir to Lord Odin,
daimyo of this country!

226
00:17:43,120 --> 00:17:45,600
I am Kozuki Momonosuke!

227
00:17:45,960 --> 00:17:46,800
It's time!

228
00:17:47,380 --> 00:17:48,520
Let us rise up!

229
00:17:59,860 --> 00:18:04,800
It warms my heart to see Lord Momonosuke
taking charge so boldly. Forgive me.

230
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:06,529
I must take leave for now.

231
00:18:06,720 --> 00:18:11,680
But you have my word I shall rejoin you
before the battle. Very well. Understood.

232
00:18:17,380 --> 00:18:18,210
Oh,

233
00:18:18,293 --> 00:18:19,123
my

234
00:18:19,206 --> 00:18:24,700
God.

235
00:18:56,580 --> 00:18:59,180
Are we finally done with this?

236
00:18:59,400 --> 00:19:01,240
I've got too many damn ninjas.

237
00:19:01,500 --> 00:19:02,760
Pain in my ass.

238
00:19:04,180 --> 00:19:05,920
Zoro-Judo, are you injured?

239
00:19:06,300 --> 00:19:07,340
I'm fine.

240
00:19:08,740 --> 00:19:09,720
Forgive me.

241
00:19:09,980 --> 00:19:11,240
