243
00:19:14,600 --> 00:19:16,380
Well, maybe a bit.

244
00:19:16,880 --> 00:19:21,056
But if you got killed, I'd never be
able to show my face to Momonosuke.

245
00:19:27,680 --> 00:19:29,117
So where do we head next?

246
00:19:29,200 --> 00:19:30,637
That house in the snow, right?

247
00:19:30,720 --> 00:19:32,577
